Jarvis is a native-macOS control surface over an existing local/cloud LLM stack.
It does not vendor that stack: the AI model weights, inference engines, and
text-to-speech engines it uses are downloaded at runtime or run as separate
processes, each under its own license. See THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for the
component manifest and the licenses (including model-weight terms) that apply.
